{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000006", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000008"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "zones where non-Saudi buyers can own real estate, rent it out and sell for profit.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000006"}, {"quote": "eligibility changes, ownership rights changes, permitted percentages changes.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000007"}, {"quote": "they talk about Saudi property as the whole country is one opportunity. It isn't.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000008"}], "text": "The speaker describes changes in Saudi's real estate market eligibility and zoning, emphasizing complex investment decisions due to varying eligibility and rights in different zones across cities."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Describing real estate market dynamics", "topic": "Saudi real estate"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:expression:71ed4e280bb508f4", "metadata_hash": "cab6ab5cedbd656ffe71f6ca9ff0fbdb2acab082a34c336ec09779f401df0e78", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Describing real estate market dynamics", "topic": "Saudi real estate", "topic_slug": "saudi-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000010", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000011", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000012"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Dubai won Expo 2020 bid in November 2013, seven years before the event. And the market didn't wait for their Expo to open.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000010"}, {"quote": "Riyadh won Expo twenty thirteen October twenty twenty three.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000011"}, {"quote": "I'm not telling Riyadh will repeat Dubai numbers. It may not.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000012"}], "text": "The speaker compares Dubai's experience after winning Expo 2020 to Riyadh's current situation post Expo 2030 win, emphasizing potential market impacts and development timelines."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Comparison of Expo impacts in Dubai and Riyadh", "topic": "real estate comparison"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:expression:dbf0c10f7659cc54", "metadata_hash": "cab6ab5cedbd656ffe71f6ca9ff0fbdb2acab082a34c336ec09779f401df0e78", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Comparison of Expo impacts in Dubai and Riyadh", "topic": "real estate comparison", "topic_slug": "real-estate-comparison"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000026", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000027"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I cannot predict the future. Now that can anyone else who's making video about this.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000027"}], "text": "Despite being able to read regulations and see transactions, the future of real estate in Dubai and Saudi Arabia is unpredictable according to the speaker."}, "title": "Unpredictable Real Estate Future", "topic": "Real estate outlook"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:3dee8d1153a3c4d6", "metadata_hash": "cab6ab5cedbd656ffe71f6ca9ff0fbdb2acab082a34c336ec09779f401df0e78", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Unpredictable Real Estate Future", "topic": "Real estate outlook", "topic_slug": "real-estate-outlook"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000028", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000029"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Saudi Arabia has almost no public transaction history for the um international on property, that's not a criticism. It's what an early stage market looks like. Dubai looked exactly like this once, two thousand five.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000029"}], "text": "Saudi Arabia's nascent real estate market is compared to Dubai's past, showing typical early-stage market features."}, "title": "Early-Stage Market Characteristics", "topic": "Market characteristics"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:88e7e2673378902d", "metadata_hash": "cab6ab5cedbd656ffe71f6ca9ff0fbdb2acab082a34c336ec09779f401df0e78", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Early-Stage Market Characteristics", "topic": "Market characteristics", "topic_slug": "market-characteristics"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000029", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000030"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "only probably a very small percentage, maybe even two percent of people going to move before it's going to be obvious for everyone else.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000029"}], "text": "A very small percentage, maybe two percent of people, will invest in a market before it becomes obvious to others, due to their higher risk tolerance."}, "title": "High Risk Tolerance in Early Investment", "topic": "Investment strategy"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:dc932cd3da20c627", "metadata_hash": "cab6ab5cedbd656ffe71f6ca9ff0fbdb2acab082a34c336ec09779f401df0e78", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "High Risk Tolerance in Early Investment", "topic": "Investment strategy", "topic_slug": "investment-strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000031"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "offering", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "opportunities still exist for investors who know where to look. One example of the current time, 2026, is the distress deals, when the properties are become available below their potential market value.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000031"}], "text": "Opportunities still exist in Dubai for investors looking for properties available below market value through distress deals."}, "title": "Distress Deals as Investment Opportunities", "topic": "Investment opportunities"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:4e201b71e1d36de3", "metadata_hash": "cab6ab5cedbd656ffe71f6ca9ff0fbdb2acab082a34c336ec09779f401df0e78", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Distress Deals as Investment Opportunities", "topic": "Investment opportunities", "topic_slug": "investment-opportunities"}
